{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：18:47 2026-10-19 HKT<br/>發佈時間：18:47 2026-10-19 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：18:47 2026-10-19 HKT</p><img alt=\"現場為屯門仁愛堂游泳池。資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d9942f4544585d8707c0af90f041be7d/2026-10/003_16.png\"/><p>今日（19日）傍晚近6時，警方接獲報案，指一名女子於屯門青松觀路賽馬會仁愛堂游泳池的更衣室暈倒，昏迷不醒。救護車到場將她送往屯門醫院搶救，其後恢復知覺，警方正調查事件。</p><p>據了解，女子較早前在游泳池游水，其後到更衣室準備換衫時突然暈倒。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T13:20:03.221731+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T10:47:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T13:58:09.053540+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T13:17:43.688114+00:00","content_hash":"77ffa6d34b6712dae2fcc79f6ff98bfb07f114525850e0f208a48f1f6f9f1c16","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}